width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(Biskit)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;\">을 통한 온라인 신청 및 참가신청서 업로드</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">📞 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;\">문의 사항 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: 478-7970</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">★ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">신청 전 필수 확인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">재학생은 프로그램 시작 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">일전까지 취소가능 이후 불참시 대학일자리센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">취업지원센터의 프로그램만 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">개월 참여제한</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">* '</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">졸업생 및 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">월 졸업예정자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">는 졸업특화프로그램 신청 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">선착순 모집으로 졸업생 맞춤형 프로그램 및 상담 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;\">자세한 사항은 신청 링크에서 확인 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\